flowchart TB
  subgraph TEMP[Memória temporária]
    WM[Working Memory]
    SM[Session Memory]
  end
  subgraph PERSIST[Domínios persistentes futuros · opt-in e isolados]
    SEM[Semantic Memory]
    EPI[Episodic Memory]
    LTM[Long-Term Memory]
    KNOW[Knowledge Memory]
    TOOL[Tool Memory]
    USER[User Context]
  end
  WM --> RET[Policies: consent, scope, retention, expiry, delete]
  SM --> RET
  RET --> PERSIST
  PERSIST --> RETR[Retrieval with provenance]
  RETR --> CTX[Context assembly]
  ISO[Identity and tenant isolation] -. gate .-> PERSIST
  AUDIT[Access audit and redaction] -. controls .-> RETR
